{
  "key": 29711,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_ThirdFloorEasyRead",
      "en_US": [
        "The books on the third floor are\n",
        "easy to read.\r",
        "The ones down here are all too tough\n",
        "for me to understand..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_TremorWasWicked",
      "en_US": [
        "That tremor...\n",
        "It was wicked!\r",
        "I scrambled to find the book\n",
        "“Disaster Strikes Survival Guide!”"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_BookshelvesAreCrammed",
      "en_US": [
        "The ceiling-high bookshelves are\n",
        "crammed with books."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_ShelvesLinedWithBooks",
      "en_US": [
        "The shelves are lined with books\n",
        "worn from being read by many people."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_RefrainFromBringingFood",
      "en_US": [
        "Please refrain from bringing food\n",
        "or beverages into the library."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_WantToHearAboutJourney",
      "en_US": [
        "Well, hello!\n",
        "We meet again!\r",
        "After we parted, I went from Oreburgh\n",
        "to Hearthome, Celestic, then Eterna.\r",
        "Yes, the town and cities surrounding\n",
        "the foot of Mt. Coronet.\r",
        "Why my fascination with Mt. Coronet,\n",
        "you may ask?\r",
        "Well, Mt. Coronet happens to be called\n",
        "“The origin of Sinnoh.”\r",
        "I learned many things on my journey.\n",
        "Would you like to hear about them?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_LetsNotBeHasty",
      "en_US": [
        "Whoa, now let’s not be hasty!\n",
        "I really want to share this with you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_TheWayISeeIt",
      "en_US": [
        "The way I see it, our world began when\n",
        "the spirit within people was born.\r",
        "When that spirit came to be, there\n",
        "followed awareness about the world.\r",
        "Within that newborn spirit, time and\n",
        "space were intertwined as one.\r",
        "People and Pokémon, too, were but the\n",
        "same presence.\r",
        "As I understand it, people and Pokémon\n",
        "shared the spirit and awareness.\r",
        "They should have understood and\n",
        "accepted each other then.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_WantToHearMore",
      "en_US": [
        "Because they shared the same spirit,\n",
        "people and Pokémon intermingled.\r",
        "People took the place of Pokémon,\n",
        "and the opposite also held true.\r",
        "That interpretation could give us an\n",
        "idea about how our world came to be.\r",
        "A Pokémon is said to have shaped\n",
        "this world...\r",
        "Could that Pokémon be the physical form\n",
        "of the original spirit?\r",
        "Hmm... The spirit came to be, and from\n",
        "it, time and space were born...\r",
        "That seems to point to legendary\n",
        "DIALGA, the Pokémon of time, and\f",
        "PALKIA, the Pokémon of space...\r",
        "And they lead back to ARCEUS, the\n",
        "Pokémon that made them arise.\r",
        "Isn’t this interesting?\n",
        "Would you like to hear some more?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_DontTeaseMe",
      "en_US": [
        "Whoa, please don’t tease me!\n",
        "I really want to share this with you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_ThereWerePlates",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, there were also Plates, weren’t\n",
        "there?\r",
        "One Plate read, “Three beings were\n",
        "born to bind time and space.”\r",
        "Those three beings I read to mean\n",
        "the three Pokémon of the lakes.\f",
        "It’s about UXIE, MESPRIT, and AZELF.\r",
        "The myth describes how they gave\n",
        "spirit to the world, shaping it.\r",
        "But it all starts with ARCEUS, the\n",
        "first. It is known as the Original One.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_WroteDownEngravings",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, by the way, I wrote down the words\n",
        "engraved on those Plates.\r",
        "I summarized them in a book and\n",
        "donated it to this library.\r",
        "There it is in that bookshelf.\n",
        "I’d be pleased if you’d read it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_GladICameToSinnoh",
      "en_US": [
        "I have to say I’m glad I came out to\n",
        "Sinnoh.\r",
        "I suppose I’d better be off in search\n",
        "of new myths in faraway lands.\r",
        "It would be nice if our paths were to\n",
        "cross again.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SinnohAsToldOnPlates",
      "en_US": [
        "”Sinnoh’s Beginning as Told on Plates.”\r",
        "This is a collection of engravings from\n",
        "ancient Plates found in Sinnoh.\r",
        "“The Original One breathed alone before\n",
        "the universe came.”\r",
        "“When the universe was created,\n",
        "its shards became this Plate.”\r",
        "“The power of defeated giants\n",
        "infuses this Plate.”\r",
        "“Two beings of time and space set\n",
        "free from the Original One.”\r",
        "“Three beings were born to bind\n",
        "time and space.”\r",
        "“Two make matter, and three make\n",
        "spirit, shaping the world.”\r",
        "“The powers of Plates are shared\n",
        "among Pokémon.”\r",
        "“The rightful bearer of a Plate\n",
        "draws from the Plate it holds.”\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} returned the book to its\n",
        "place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, you must be the new Champion!\r",
        "I’m the Legend Archivist. I look after\n",
        "this library’s oldest records.\r",
        "Since your Hall of Fame entry, people\n",
        "have seen Pokémon new to Sinnoh.\r",
        "I found them in this tome, the Unova\n",
        "Chronicle. Unova is a faraway land.\r",
        "Its legends tell of three Pokémon\n",
        "who stood together like swords.\r",
        "And now one of them, VIRIZION, has\n",
        "been seen in northern Eterna Forest.\r",
        "How could a Pokémon of Unova come\n",
        "here? I can’t make sense of it.\r",
        "Would you look into it for me?\n",
        "I’ll keep reading the Chronicle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistSwords",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle names all three swords:\n",
        "COBALION, TERRAKION and VIRIZION.\r",
        "They never stray far from each other,\n",
        "and now all three are here in Sinnoh.\r",
        "Here’s where they’ve been seen:\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistCobalion",
      "en_US": [
        "COBALION: deep inside Iron Island,\n",
        "in a side cave two floors down.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTerrakion",
      "en_US": [
        "TERRAKION: in a hollow among the\n",
        "rocks at the north end of Route 227.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistVirizion",
      "en_US": [
        "VIRIZION: in the north of Eterna\n",
        "Forest, by the Old Chateau.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKeepReading",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll keep reading the Unova Chronicle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKeldeo",
      "en_US": [
        "You found all three swords!\r",
        "The Chronicle tells of a fourth one,\n",
        "a young Pokémon named KELDEO.\r",
        "It followed the three swords to learn\n",
        "from them, and became a sword itself.\r",
        "They say it comes to the water when\n",
        "the three swords are near.\r",
        "Lake Valor, perhaps? Go there with\n",
        "COBALION, TERRAKION and VIRIZION.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKeldeoCaught",
      "en_US": [
        "KELDEO too! All four swords of Unova,\n",
        "here in Sinnoh...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistMeloetta",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle also tells of MELOETTA,\n",
        "a Pokémon of song.\r",
        "A composer at Hearthome’s Contest\n",
        "Hall may know its melody.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGenesect",
      "en_US": [
        "And of GENESECT, an ancient Pokémon\n",
        "that people brought back and changed.\r",
        "They say Team Galactic tried that\n",
        "too, in their Veilstone lab.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistStones",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle ends with two dragons,\n",
        "RESHIRAM and ZEKROM.\r",
        "They say each one sleeps in a stone\n",
        "until a hero wakes it.\r",
        "These two stones came with the\n",
        "Chronicle. Please, take them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistReshiram",
      "en_US": [
        "RESHIRAM: the LIGHT STONE is warm,\n",
        "like a fire. Try Fuego Ironworks.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZekrom",
      "en_US": [
        "ZEKROM: the DARK STONE crackles.\n",
        "Try the Valley Windworks, at night.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKyurem",
      "en_US": [
        "RESHIRAM and ZEKROM, both here!\r",
        "The Chronicle tells of a third dragon,\n",
        "KYUREM, left empty when they split.\r",
        "It sleeps in the ice. Try the icy\n",
        "chamber in Mt. Coronet by Route 216.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistDNASplicers",
      "en_US": [
        "KYUREM too! The Chronicle says it can\n",
        "join with RESHIRAM or ZEKROM.\r",
        "These DNA SPLICERS came with the\n",
        "Chronicle. They join and split them.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistForcesRelease",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle also tells of TORNADUS\n",
        "and THUNDURUS, who ride the clouds.\r",
        "Have you felt the wild winds and the\n",
        "storms lately? They must be here!\r",
        "They never stay in one place. Look\n",
        "for them all over Sinnoh.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRoamers",
      "en_US": [
        "TORNADUS and THUNDURUS roam all\n",
        "over Sinnoh.\r",
        "A Pokétch’s Marking Map can show\n",
        "you where they are.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRoamerGone",
      "en_US": [
        "If one was knocked out, come back and\n",
        "ask me after your next Hall of Fame.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRevealGlass",
      "en_US": [
        "You caught TORNADUS and THUNDURUS!\r",
        "The Chronicle says this REVEAL GLASS\n",
        "shows their true forms.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistLandorus",
      "en_US": [
        "LANDORUS, lord of the land, once\n",
        "stopped the two of them.\r",
        "Take TORNADUS and THUNDURUS to the\n",
        "sands of Route 228, and see!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistEnamorus",
      "en_US": [
        "And ENAMORUS, who brings the spring...\r",
        "They say it waits on the beach\n",
        "of Route 224.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistWhichLegend",
      "en_US": [
        "Which legend of the Unova Chronicle\n",
        "shall I read to you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistAnythingElse",
      "en_US": [
        "Anything else from the Chronicle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuSwords",
      "en_US": [
        "Swords of Justice"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuDragons",
      "en_US": [
        "Truth and Ideals"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuForces",
      "en_US": [
        "Forces of Nature"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuOthers",
      "en_US": [
        "Other legends"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuDone",
      "en_US": [
        "That’s all"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistDragonsDone",
      "en_US": [
        "RESHIRAM, ZEKROM and KYUREM...\n",
        "You found all three dragons!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistForcesDone",
      "en_US": [
        "You’ve met all four of the Forces\n",
        "of Nature!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistOthersDone",
      "en_US": [
        "You found VICTINI, MELOETTA and\n",
        "GENESECT too!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistVictini",
      "en_US": [
        "And of VICTINI, who brings victory\n",
        "to those it likes.\r",
        "It loves a view of the sea. Try the\n",
        "top of Sunyshore’s Vista Lighthouse.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKalosOpens",
      "en_US": [
        "You caught KYUREM! That was the last\n",
        "legend of the Unova Chronicle.\r",
        "And look what was tucked behind it:\n",
        "a second tome, the Kalos Chronicle!\r",
        "Its legends begin with XERNEAS, who\n",
        "gives life, and YVELTAL, who takes it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistWhichChronicle",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Chronicle shall I read from?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuUnova",
      "en_US": [
        "Unova Chronicle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuKalos",
      "en_US": [
        "Kalos Chronicle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKeepReadingChronicles",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll keep reading the Chronicles."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKalosWhichLegend",
      "en_US": [
        "Which legend of the Kalos Chronicle\n",
        "shall I read to you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuLife",
      "en_US": [
        "Life and Destruction"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKalosKeepReading",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll keep reading the Kalos Chronicle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistLife",
      "en_US": [
        "XERNEAS and YVELTAL keep life in\n",
        "balance, the Chronicle says.\r",
        "Where one rests, the land blooms.\n",
        "Where the other rests, it withers.\r",
        "Here’s where they’ve been seen:\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistXerneas",
      "en_US": [
        "XERNEAS: in Eterna Forest, in the\n",
        "green nook beside the Old Chateau.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistYveltal",
      "en_US": [
        "YVELTAL: in a hidden nook on\n",
        "Route 229, past a tree to Cut.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZygarde",
      "en_US": [
        "XERNEAS and YVELTAL, both here!\r",
        "The Chronicle tells of a third one,\n",
        "ZYGARDE, who keeps them in order.\r",
        "It watches from deep below. Try the\n",
        "lowest floor of Wayward Cave.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistLifeDone",
      "en_US": [
        "XERNEAS, YVELTAL and ZYGARDE...\n",
        "You found all three!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZygardeCube",
      "en_US": [
        "ZYGARDE is made of countless cells,\n",
        "the Chronicle says. This ZYGARDE CUBE\r",
        "gathers them or scatters them to\n",
        "change its form. Please, take it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistDiancie",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle also tells of DIANCIE,\n",
        "a jewel born among CARBINK.\r",
        "A CARBINK might lead you to\n",
        "it, deep in Oreburgh Mine.\r",
        "CARBINK live outside Stark Mountain.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistPrisonBottle",
      "en_US": [
        "And of HOOPA, a prankster that was\n",
        "sealed away in a bottle.\r",
        "This PRISON BOTTLE came with the\n",
        "Chronicle. Please, take it.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistHoopa",
      "en_US": [
        "HOOPA: they say it plays in a dead\n",
        "end deep in the Solaceon Ruins.\r",
        "Take the PRISON BOTTLE there!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistVolcanion",
      "en_US": [
        "And of VOLCANION, who lives in heat\n",
        "and steam.\r",
        "Try the dead-end tunnel deep in\n",
        "Stark Mountain’s second cave.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKalosOthersDone",
      "en_US": [
        "You found DIANCIE, HOOPA and\n",
        "VOLCANION too!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistAlolaOpens",
      "en_US": [
        "XERNEAS and YVELTAL, the heart of\n",
        "the Kalos Chronicle, both caught!\r",
        "And look! A third tome has opened:\n",
        "the Alola Chronicle!\r",
        "Alola is a land of islands. Its\n",
        "legends tell of guardians, and of\r",
        "Pokémon that came from the sky.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuAlola",
      "en_US": [
        "Alola Chronicle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistAlolaWhichLegend",
      "en_US": [
        "Which legend of the Alola Chronicle\n",
        "shall I read to you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistAlolaKeepReading",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll keep reading the Alola Chronicle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuGuardians",
      "en_US": [
        "Island Guardians"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuSky",
      "en_US": [
        "Sun and Moon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGuardians",
      "en_US": [
        "Each island of Alola has a guardian,\n",
        "the Chronicle says. Four of them!\r",
        "They like the sea and the flowers.\n",
        "Here’s where they’ve been seen:\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTapuKoko",
      "en_US": [
        "TAPU KOKO: on the beach at the\n",
        "east end of Route 222.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTapuLele",
      "en_US": [
        "TAPU LELE: in the grove on\n",
        "Fullmoon Island.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTapuBulu",
      "en_US": [
        "TAPU BULU: among the flowers of\n",
        "Floaroma Meadow.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTapuFini",
      "en_US": [
        "TAPU FINI: on a little beach out\n",
        "at sea, on Route 226.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGuardiansDone",
      "en_US": [
        "All four guardians of Alola...\n",
        "You found every one!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistCosmog",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle tells of COSMOG, a\n",
        "little Pokémon from beyond the sky.\r",
        "It appears where the sky is thin...\n",
        "the top of Mt. Coronet, perhaps?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistCosmogRaise",
      "en_US": [
        "Raise your COSMOG well. The\n",
        "Chronicle says it becomes COSMOEM,\r",
        "then SOLGALEO with a SUN STONE,\n",
        "or LUNALA with a MOON STONE.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistCosmogAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "Another COSMOG may wait atop\n",
        "Mt. Coronet now, for the other form!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistNecrozma",
      "en_US": [
        "And the Chronicle warns of\n",
        "NECROZMA, who steals the light.\r",
        "It hides where the light is gone:\n",
        "the dark back room of Wayward Cave.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistSkyDone",
      "en_US": [
        "Two COSMOG and NECROZMA...\n",
        "The legends of the sky are yours!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistSolarizers",
      "en_US": [
        "NECROZMA too! The Chronicle says it\n",
        "can join with SOLGALEO or LUNALA.\r",
        "These two came with the Chronicle:\n",
        "the N-SOLARIZER and N-LUNARIZER.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuUltra",
      "en_US": [
        "Ultra Beasts"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistUltraLocked",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle tells of Ultra Beasts\n",
        "from beyond holes in the sky.\r",
        "They say NECROZMA opens the way.\n",
        "Find it first!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistUltra",
      "en_US": [
        "Since you caught NECROZMA, Ultra\n",
        "Beasts have been seen in Sinnoh!\r",
        "They’re rare in the wild, so\n",
        "keep looking. Here’s where:\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistNihilego",
      "en_US": [
        "NIHILEGO: on the lowest floor of\n",
        "Iron Island.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistBuzzwole",
      "en_US": [
        "BUZZWOLE: in the grass of Route 225.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistPheromosa",
      "en_US": [
        "PHEROMOSA: in the grass of Route 229.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistXurkitree",
      "en_US": [
        "XURKITREE: along the\n",
        "power lines of Route 222.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistCelesteela",
      "en_US": [
        "CELESTEELA: high on the snowy\n",
        "slopes of Mt. Coronet.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKartana",
      "en_US": [
        "KARTANA: in Eterna Forest.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGuzzlord",
      "en_US": [
        "GUZZLORD: in the rooms\n",
        "of Turnback Cave.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistStakataka",
      "en_US": [
        "STAKATAKA: on Route 227.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistBlacephalon",
      "en_US": [
        "BLACEPHALON: outside Stark Mountain.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistUltraDone",
      "en_US": [
        "All nine Ultra Beasts... Your\n",
        "record of them is complete!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuAlolaOthers",
      "en_US": [
        "Other legends"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistPoipole",
      "en_US": [
        "POIPOLE: one came through\n",
        "a wormhole after NECROZMA.\r",
        "Catch NECROZMA, then look on\n",
        "Route 230, east of the Fight Area.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTypeNull",
      "en_US": [
        "TYPE: NULL: the scientist’s other\n",
        "experiment, once GENESECT is caught.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistMagearna",
      "en_US": [
        "MAGEARNA: an old automaton in\n",
        "Volkner’s room at the Sunyshore Gym.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistMarshadow",
      "en_US": [
        "MARSHADOW: in the shadows of the\n",
        "Old Chateau’s dining room.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZeraora",
      "en_US": [
        "ZERAORA: it runs all over\n",
        "Sinnoh like lightning.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistMeltan",
      "en_US": [
        "MELTAN: somewhere in\n",
        "Oreburgh Mine.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistMelmetal",
      "en_US": [
        "MELMETAL: it comes to Oreburgh Mine\n",
        "once you catch MELTAN.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistAlolaOthersDone",
      "en_US": [
        "All the other legends of Alola...\n",
        "You found every one!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGalarOpens",
      "en_US": [
        "SOLGALEO or LUNALA, here in Sinnoh!\n",
        "The Alola Chronicle’s key legend.\r",
        "And look! A fourth tome has opened:\n",
        "the Galar Chronicle!\r",
        "Galar is a land of knights. Its\n",
        "legends tell of a sword and a shield.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuGalar",
      "en_US": [
        "Galar Chronicle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGalarWhichLegend",
      "en_US": [
        "Which legend of the Galar Chronicle\n",
        "shall I read to you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGalarKeepReading",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll keep reading the Galar Chronicle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuHeroes",
      "en_US": [
        "The Hero Legends"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuKing",
      "en_US": [
        "King of Harvests"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZacian",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle tells of two heroes,\n",
        "a sword and a shield.\r",
        "ZACIAN, the sword, waits in the fog\n",
        "of Route 210, north of Solaceon.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZamazenta",
      "en_US": [
        "ZAMAZENTA, the shield, has come to\n",
        "the fog of Route 210 now.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistEternatus",
      "en_US": [
        "Both heroes! The Chronicle warns of\n",
        "ETERNATUS, who brought the darkness.\r",
        "It waits on an island in the\n",
        "depths of Victory Road.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistHeroesDone",
      "en_US": [
        "ZACIAN, ZAMAZENTA and ETERNATUS...\n",
        "The heroes’ legend is yours!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistCalyrex",
      "en_US": [
        "CALYREX, the King of Bountiful\n",
        "Harvests, waits in Celestic Town.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistReins",
      "en_US": [
        "CALYREX! The Chronicle says it rode\n",
        "two steeds. These REINS OF UNITY\r",
        "came with the Chronicle. They join\n",
        "the king and a steed.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGlastrier",
      "en_US": [
        "GLASTRIER: it runs\n",
        "free all over Sinnoh.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistSpectrier",
      "en_US": [
        "SPECTRIER: it runs\n",
        "free all over Sinnoh.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKingDone",
      "en_US": [
        "CALYREX and both its steeds...\n",
        "You found them all!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKubfu",
      "en_US": [
        "KUBFU: training in the\n",
        "Veilstone Gym.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistScrolls",
      "en_US": [
        "KUBFU! The Chronicle says it grows\n",
        "by studying a scroll.\r",
        "These two SCROLLS came with the\n",
        "Chronicle. Show KUBFU one!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZarude",
      "en_US": [
        "ZARUDE: in the marshy grass south\n",
        "of Route 212.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistNewRegis",
      "en_US": [
        "Two more REGI sleep in Sinnoh. They\n",
        "wake for REGIROCK, REGICE and\r",
        "REGISTEEL, all in your party.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRegieleki",
      "en_US": [
        "REGIELEKI: inside the Valley\n",
        "Windworks.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRegidrago",
      "en_US": [
        "REGIDRAGO: in the ruins on\n",
        "Route 228.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistGalarOthersDone",
      "en_US": [
        "KUBFU, ZARUDE and the two REGI...\n",
        "You found them all!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistPaldeaOpens",
      "en_US": [
        "ZACIAN and ZAMAZENTA, the heroes of\n",
        "the Galar Chronicle, both caught!\r",
        "And look! The last tome has opened:\n",
        "the Paldea Chronicle!\r",
        "Paldea is a land of treasures, and\n",
        "of a great crater deep in the earth.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuPaldea",
      "en_US": [
        "Paldea Chronicle"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistPaldeaWhichLegend",
      "en_US": [
        "Which legend of the Paldea Chronicle\n",
        "shall I read to you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistPaldeaKeepReading",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ll keep reading the Paldea\n",
        "Chronicle."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuRuin",
      "en_US": [
        "Treasures of Ruin"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuLoyal",
      "en_US": [
        "The Loyal Three"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuOgre",
      "en_US": [
        "The Masked Ogre"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuRifts",
      "en_US": [
        "Paradox Pokémon"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignMenuAreaZero",
      "en_US": [
        "Area Zero"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRuin",
      "en_US": [
        "Four Treasures of Ruin are sealed in\n",
        "Sinnoh, each by two stakes.\r",
        "Pull out both stakes near a shrine,\n",
        "and its treasure wakes:\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistWoChien",
      "en_US": [
        "WO-CHIEN: on the north part of\n",
        "Route 212.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistChienPao",
      "en_US": [
        "CHIEN-PAO: by Lake Acuity, on the\n",
        "lakefront.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTingLu",
      "en_US": [
        "TING-LU: on Route 214.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistChiYu",
      "en_US": [
        "CHI-YU: outside Fuego Ironworks.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRuinDone",
      "en_US": [
        "All four Treasures of Ruin...\n",
        "You found them all!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistOkidogi",
      "en_US": [
        "OKIDOGI: one of the Loyal\n",
        "Three, roaming all over Sinnoh.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistMunkidori",
      "en_US": [
        "MUNKIDORI: one of the Loyal\n",
        "Three, roaming all over Sinnoh.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistFezandipiti",
      "en_US": [
        "FEZANDIPITI: one of the Loyal\n",
        "Three, roaming all over Sinnoh.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistPecharunt",
      "en_US": [
        "All three! Their master, PECHARUNT,\n",
        "has come to Route 224.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistLoyalDone",
      "en_US": [
        "The Loyal Three and PECHARUNT...\n",
        "You found them all!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistOgerpon",
      "en_US": [
        "OGERPON, the masked ogre, waits by\n",
        "the path on Route 211, east side.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistOgerponMasks",
      "en_US": [
        "A man in Celestic Town kept masks\n",
        "for OGERPON. Show it to him!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistOgreDone",
      "en_US": [
        "OGERPON and all its masks...\n",
        "The ogre’s legend is yours!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRifts",
      "en_US": [
        "Paradox Pokémon, from the past and\n",
        "the future... Have you heard?\r",
        "Two collectors at the Oreburgh\n",
        "Mining Museum trade in them!\r",
        "Show them a Pokémon of today, and\n",
        "they may have its Paradox kin.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistRiftsDone",
      "en_US": [
        "All twenty Paradox Pokémon...\n",
        "Your record of them is complete!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistAreaZeroLocked",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle’s last pages speak of\n",
        "a crater, Area Zero.\r",
        "Gather every ancient Paradox Pokémon,\n",
        "and KORAIDON may come.\r",
        "Every future one, and MIRAIDON.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKoraidon",
      "en_US": [
        "KORAIDON and MIRAIDON have come to\n",
        "Sendoff Spring!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistTerapagos",
      "en_US": [
        "Both of them! And now TERAPAGOS,\n",
        "the crater’s heart, is at Sendoff\r",
        "Spring too.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistAreaZeroDone",
      "en_US": [
        "KORAIDON, MIRAIDON and TERAPAGOS...\n",
        "Every legend of the Chronicles!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistZeraoraRelease",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle also tells of\n",
        "ZERAORA, who moves like lightning.\r",
        "It never stays in one place.\n",
        "Look for it all over Sinnoh!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistMarkingMap",
      "en_US": [
        "A Pokétch’s Marking Map can show\n",
        "you where roaming Pokémon are.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistSteedsRelease",
      "en_US": [
        "With their king caught, GLASTRIER\n",
        "and SPECTRIER have bolted!\r",
        "They run all over Sinnoh now.\n",
        "Catch one and join it to the king!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistLoyalRelease",
      "en_US": [
        "The Chronicle tells of the Loyal\n",
        "Three, who serve a cruel master.\r",
        "They’re loose in Sinnoh now, and\n",
        "they never stay in one place!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistKoraidonOne",
      "en_US": [
        "One of Area Zero’s masters has come\n",
        "to Sendoff Spring!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveLibrary2F_Text_SovereignArchivistUltranecrozium",
      "en_US": [
        "And this crystal: ULTRANECROZIUM Z.\n",
        "A fused NECROZMA holding it can\r",
        "Ultra Burst in battle and regain\n",
        "its true power!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
